  "description": "Core document abstractions: DoclingDocument structured model, IDocumentLoader, IDocumentParser, Markdown serialization, and element types (TextItem, TableItem, CodeItem, etc.). Framework-agnostic and usable with any RAG pipeline or document processing system.",
